"Click this checkbox to enable the entry of multi-key shortcuts.  A multi-key "
"shortcut consists of a sequence of up to 4 keys.  For example, you could "
"assign \"Ctrl+F,B\" to Font-Italics and \"Ctrl+F,U\" to Font-Underline."
